      "category": "phase transformation",
      "sample_id": "sample_1",
      "material_state": "as-fabricated",
      "assertion_level": "directly_reported",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 6,
          "section": "4.1. Evolution of crystallographic structure of ZrO2",
          "quote": "The tetragonal t-ZrO2 can transform to the monoclinic m-ZrO2 through either stress or thermal activity, a process known as martensitic phase transformation, which is often accompanied by the reorientation of twin laths in the microstructure",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "2214cf843135f1b8:part:002"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mechanism_2",
      "name": "transformation induced plasticity (TRIP)",
      "category": "toughening",
      "sample_id": "sample_1",
      "material_state": "as-fabricated",
      "assertion_level": "author_interpretation",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 10,
          "section": "4.2.2. Ductilizing",
          "quote": "The presence of martensitic tetragonal-to-monoclinic transformation in ZrO2 can be controlled to provide plasticity during tension, improving the ductility through transformation induced plasticity (TRIP)",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "2214cf843135f1b8:part:002"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mechanism_3",
      "name": "twinning induced plasticity (TWIP)",
      "category": "toughening",
      "sample_id": "sample_1",
      "material_state": "as-fabricated",
      "assertion_level": "author_interpretation",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 10,
          "section": "4.2.2. Ductilizing",
          "quote": "The progressive transformation and twinning of ZrO2 during tension can accommodate incoming strains, effectively relieving the stress concentration caused by dislocation pile-up and leading to prolonged uniform elongation and enhanced work hardening due to the synthetical effect of TWIP and TRIP",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "2214cf843135f1b8:part:002"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mechanism_4",
